title: 'approval-voting: prune every wakeup when the finalized number is BlockNumber::MAX'
doc:
  - audience: Node Dev
    description: |
      Pruning finalized wakeups no longer overflows when the finalized block number is
      BlockNumber::MAX. Every tracked block is pruned at that height.
crates:
  - name: polkadot-node-core-approval-voting
    bump: patch
